{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2023-05-17 14:45:00', 'title': 'BOEING PUBLICLY LAUNCHES "CASCADE" TO SUPPORT AVIATION\'S NET ZERO GOAL', 'text': "SEATTLE , MAY 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN SUPPORT OF COMMERCIAL AVIATION'S PATH TOWARD NET ZERO CARBON EMISSIONS, BOEING (NYSE: BA) TODAY RELEASED THE BOEING CASCADE CLIMATE IMPACT MODEL FOR PUBLIC USE. CASCADE, A DATA MODELING TOOL THAT IDENTIFIES THE EFFECTS OF A RANGE OF SUSTAINABILITY SOLUTIONS TO REDUCE AVIATION'S CARBON EMISSIONS, IS ACCESSIBLE ON BOEING'S NEW SUSTAINABLE AEROSPACE TOGETHER HUB, WWW.SUSTAINABILITYTOGETHER.AERO."}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2023-05-17 11:00:00', 'title': 'BOEING CEO DAVE CALHOUN TO SPEAK AT BERNSTEIN STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE JUNE 2', 'text': 'ARLINGTON, VA. , MAY 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOEING [NYSE: BA] CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER DAVE CALHOUN WILL SPEAK AT BERNSTEIN STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE ON JUNE 2ND AT 8:00 A.M.'}